  "description": "Canonical OmniAGI harness registry. This file is the single source of truth for the master, specialist subroutines, tools, engine seats and routing rules. Markdown tables that describe any of these are GENERATED from this file - never edit the generated blocks by hand.",
  "master": {
    "id": "omniagi",
